{"language_code":"eng","language_probability":0.9709885120391846,"text":"[intro jingle] Hey everyone. So, no Mortal Steel today. In part because I sound like this. [laughs] Not exactly the, uh, narrative effect I'm going for. Obviously, I have lost my voice. Uh, but in addition, um, we've got a lot of very exciting things happening on the Web3 side, and I'm gonna be working a lot on those, which means that production will slow down as I'm a one-person post-production team. But we'll finish Mortal Steel episodes eleven and twelve, um, just as soon as I can without going crazy. [laughs] We also have a very exciting sound design and writing contest coming up soon. I'm still putting that together. It's likely that I'll release some short-form content next week, assuming I can find another narrator. [laughs] Um, and then if I'm able, I'll resume production for episode eleven the week following for a release in about three weeks. Now, if you would like to stay up to date on the show, I recommend joining the Discord. I'm putting a link in the show notes, but you can also find a link at collectedaudio.com. I cannot wait to share all the wonderful and exciting things that I'm working on. I'll be in the Discord where I can type instead of speak. See ya.","words":[{"text":"[intro jingle]","start":0.06,"end":5.8,"type":"audio_event","speaker_id":"speaker_0","logprob":-0.2744107165219854},{"text":" ","start":5.8,"end":5.82,"type":"spacing","speaker_id":"speaker_0","logprob":-0.0015573289711028337},{"text":"Hey","start":5.88,"end":6.06,"type":"word","speaker_id":"speaker_0","logprob":-0.0015573289711028337},{"text":" ","start":6.06,"end":6.12,"type":"spacing","speaker_id":"speaker_0","logprob":-0.0181779395788908},{"text":"everyone.","start":6.12,"end":6.68,"type":"word","speaker_id":"speaker_0","logprob":-0.016180431929468695},{"text":" ","start":6.68,"end":6.68,"type":"spacing","speaker_id":"speaker_0","logprob":-0.00861605815589428},{"text":"So,","start":7.56,"end":7.82,"type"